{"seq":3,"slug":"hand-eye-tracking","title":"手部与眼动追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webxr-immersive-web/tracking/hand-eye-tracking","wordCount":1143,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"手部与眼动追踪\">手部与眼动追踪</h1><p>放下控制器，直接用手在空中捏、抓、指——这是 XR 交互最自然的形态，也是 Vision Pro 把「注视加捏合」做成系统级输入后被广泛接受的范式。手部追踪让浏览器拿到你二十多个手指关节的实时位姿，眼动追踪让系统知道你在看哪。两者都是身体的精细信号，属于「被动观测」的追踪范畴，但它们紧挨着输入——这一篇讲怎么取这些信号，下一章讲怎么把它们变成动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-手部追踪-25-个关节的骨架\">核心概念：手部追踪：25 个关节的骨架</h2><p>手部追踪通过手部输入模块（hand input module）暴露。申请会话时把 <code>hand-tracking</code> 放进 <code>optionalFeatures</code>，运行时每只手会作为一个 <code>XRInputSource</code> 出现，并带一个 <code>hand</code> 属性——那是一个关节集合，每只手有 25 个关节，从手腕到每根手指的指尖，构成完整骨架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const session = await navigator.xr.requestSession(&#39;immersive-vr&#39;, {&#10;  optionalFeatures: [&#39;hand-tracking&#39;],&#10;});&#10;&#10;function onXRFrame(t, frame) {&#10;  for (const source of frame.session.inputSources) {&#10;    if (!source.hand) continue; // 该输入源是手才有 hand&#10;    const indexTip = source.hand.get(&#39;index-finger-tip&#39;);&#10;    const thumbTip = source.hand.get(&#39;thumb-tip&#39;);&#10;    const idxPose = frame.getJointPose(indexTip, refSpace);&#10;    const thbPose = frame.getJointPose(thumbTip, refSpace);&#10;    if (idxPose &amp;&amp; thbPose) {&#10;      const pinch = distance(idxPose.transform.position, thbPose.transform.position);&#10;      // pinch &lt; 0.02 米 ≈ 捏合&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const session = await navigator.xr.requestSession('immersive-vr', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  optionalFeatures: ['hand-tracking'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function onXRFrame(t, frame) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const source of frame.session.inputSources) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!source.hand) continue; // 该输入源是手才有 hand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const indexTip = source.hand.get('index-finger-tip');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const thumbTip = source.hand.get('thumb-tip');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const idxPose = frame.getJointPose(indexTip, refSpace);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const thbPose = frame.getJointPose(thumbTip, refSpace);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (idxPose &#x26;&#x26; thbPose) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const pinch = distance(idxPose.transform.position, thbPose.transform.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // pinch &#x3C; 0.02 米 ≈ 捏合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键 API 是 <code>frame.getJointPose(joint, refSpace)</code>，它返回的 <code>XRJointPose</code> 比普通位姿多一个 <code>radius</code>——该关节的估计半径，可用来画粗细合适的手部网格或做碰撞。常用关节名是有约定的字符串：<code>wrist</code>、<code>thumb-tip</code>、<code>index-finger-tip</code>、<code>middle-finger-phalanx-proximal</code> 等等，二十五个名字覆盖五指各节加手腕。</p>\n<p>最常用的派生手势是<strong>捏合</strong>：算拇指尖与食指尖的欧氏距离</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\sqrt{(x_1-x_2)^2 + (y_1-y_2)^2 + (z_1-z_2)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.2561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 小于约 2 厘米即判为捏合。注意手部追踪给的是关节位姿，<strong>手势识别要你自己做</strong>——WebXR 不内置「这是捏合还是握拳」的判定，你在原始关节数据上算。不过当手部以「注视加捏合」方式驱动选择时，浏览器会把它包装成标准的 select 事件（见下文与《<a href=\"../input/select-events\">选择与抓取事件</a>》），这部分不用你自己识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关节层级与坐标\">关节层级与坐标</h2><p>二十五个关节不是平铺的，它们构成一棵从手腕向指尖延伸的骨架树。理解这棵树有助于做手部网格绑定与反向动力学：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W[wrist 手腕] --&gt; T[thumb 拇指链]&#10;  W --&gt; I[index 食指链]&#10;  W --&gt; M[middle 中指链]&#10;  W --&gt; R[ring 无名指链]&#10;  W --&gt; P[pinky 小指链]&#10;  I --&gt; I1[掌指关节&lt;br/&gt;metacarpal]&#10;  I1 --&gt; I2[近节&lt;br/&gt;phalanx-proximal]&#10;  I2 --&gt; I3[中节&lt;br/&gt;phalanx-intermediate]&#10;  I3 --&gt; I4[远节&lt;br/&gt;phalanx-distal]&#10;  I4 --&gt; I5[指尖&lt;br/&gt;finger-tip]\">graph TD\n  W[wrist 手腕] --&gt; T[thumb 拇指链]\n  W --&gt; I[index 食指链]\n  W --&gt; M[middle 中指链]\n  W --&gt; R[ring 无名指链]\n  W --&gt; P[pinky 小指链]\n  I --&gt; I1[掌指关节&lt;br/&gt;metacarpal]\n  I1 --&gt; I2[近节&lt;br/&gt;phalanx-proximal]\n  I2 --&gt; I3[中节&lt;br/&gt;phalanx-intermediate]\n  I3 --&gt; I4[远节&lt;br/&gt;phalanx-distal]\n  I4 --&gt; I5[指尖&lt;br/&gt;finger-tip]</pre><p>每个关节位姿都相对你传入的参考空间，单位米、右手系，与《<a href=\"../foundations/xr-coordinate-systems\">坐标与位姿</a>》一致。批量取所有关节时，部分实现提供 <code>frame.fillPoses</code> / <code>fillJointRadii</code> 一次性填满数组，比逐个 <code>getJointPose</code> 高效——手部每帧 25 个关节、双手 50 个，逐个查询的开销在帧预算里不可忽视，这点呼应《<a href=\"../practice/xr-performance\">性能与舒适度</a>》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"眼动与注视输入\">眼动与注视输入</h2><p>眼动追踪在 WebXR 里走得比手部更谨慎，原因是隐私：眼动数据能泄露注意力、甚至健康与身份信息，原始 gaze 向量不会被随意暴露给网页。</p>\n<p>实践中眼动主要以两种受控形式出现。其一是 <strong><code>gaze</code> 瞄准模式</strong>：某些设备没有手柄定位能力时，输入源的 <code>targetRayMode</code> 为 <code>gaze</code>，射线从用户视线方向射出，用户「看哪指哪」。其二是 visionOS 上的<strong>注视加捏合</strong>：系统用眼动决定你看着哪个元素、用捏合确认，但网页拿到的只是一个落在目标上的 <code>transient-pointer</code> 输入与标准 select 事件，<strong>拿不到原始注视坐标</strong>——系统替你做了隐私隔离。Safari 在 visionOS 上对更底层的眼动相关能力仍要求用户在高级设置里显式开启（<a href=\"https://www.testmuai.com/learning-hub/webxr-compatible-browsers/\">TestMu AI, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>下表对比手部与眼动两类信号的可得性与设计取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>手部追踪</th>\n<th>眼动 / 注视</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴露形式</td>\n<td>25 个关节原始位姿</td>\n<td>多数仅 <code>gaze</code>/<code>transient-pointer</code> 包装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原始数据</td>\n<td>关节位姿可读</td>\n<td>原始注视坐标通常不可读（隐私）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手势识别</td>\n<td>自己在关节上算</td>\n<td>系统包装为标准事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特性名</td>\n<td><code>hand-tracking</code></td>\n<td>随平台，常需显式授权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要顾虑</td>\n<td>性能（每帧多关节）</td>\n<td>隐私</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>手部追踪经 <code>hand-tracking</code> 特性暴露，每只手是带 <code>hand</code> 的 <code>XRInputSource</code>，含 25 个关节；用 <code>frame.getJointPose</code> 取位姿，<code>XRJointPose</code> 多一个 <code>radius</code>。</li>\n<li>捏合等手势要你自己在关节距离上判定（如拇指尖-食指尖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d&lt;2\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）；WebXR 不内置手势识别，但「注视加捏合」会被包装成标准 select 事件。</li>\n<li>关节构成从手腕到指尖的骨架树；批量取用 <code>fillPoses</code> 比逐关节 <code>getJointPose</code> 省帧预算。</li>\n<li>眼动因隐私被严格管控：多以 <code>gaze</code> 瞄准或 visionOS 的 <code>transient-pointer</code> 注视捏合出现，网页通常拿不到原始注视坐标；Safari 需显式授权。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>关节位姿所依赖的坐标系：<a href=\"../foundations/xr-coordinate-systems\">坐标与位姿</a></li>\n<li>手作为输入源的完整结构：<a href=\"../input/xr-input-controllers\">控制器输入</a></li>\n<li>捏合/注视如何变成 select 动作：<a href=\"../input/select-events\">选择与抓取事件</a></li>\n<li>每帧多关节查询的性能影响：<a href=\"../practice/xr-performance\">性能与舒适度</a></li>\n<li>跨库：多人共享手部/在场状态的同步 <a href=\"../../realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/awareness-and-presence\">在场感与 awareness</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"手部与眼动追踪","id":"手部与眼动追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：手部追踪：25 个关节的骨架","id":"核心概念-手部追踪-25-个关节的骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"关节层级与坐标","id":"关节层级与坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"眼动与注视输入","id":"眼动与注视输入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"命中测试与锚点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webxr-immersive-web/tracking/hit-test-anchors"},"next":{"title":"控制器输入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webxr-immersive-web/input/xr-input-controllers"}}